## What is Vestiaire Collective?

Vestiaire Collective is a global platform for buying and selling pre-owned luxury and designer fashion. Founded in 2009, the platform allows individuals to buy and sell women's and men's clothing, handbags, shoes, accessories, jewelry, watches, and more from over 12,000 brands, including Louis Vuitton, Chanel, Gucci, and Hermès. Shoppers can get extra peace of mind with Vestiaire Collective's world-class Authentication & Quality Control process, which includes physical inspection at the company's warehouse. Headquartered in Paris, Vestiaire Collective operates in 70+ countries, maintains over 5 million active item listings, and adds approximately 35,000 new items daily. Vestiaire Collective maintains global offices in London, New York, Berlin, Lisbon, Ho Chi Minh City, Singapore, and Hong Kong.

